## SEVERITY / VERDICT (decided HERE; round 1's table, restated)
*Blocker:* a user-visible string in neither a stamped value nor an on-screen string; a non-Admin or anonymous caller acts or reads; a refusal that changes anything; a held item reaches the dispatcher or is sent without Approve; Delete leaves comment, page or a file, or loses the row or its audit, or an audit row holds comment text; user erase leaves `held`; the person's erasure changed for old states; migration fails on an empty DB or loses a `pending` row; Down converts or loses held rows; contract drift, copies unequal or version not bumped; a path beyond the allowed set; an assertion loosened or skipped; lint, typecheck, build, `audit-dev`, `check-shards` red; names lost; a secret; a person name, card id or **a brief number NEW in an added line (token-level, step 1)** in code or message; **the lead or any rendered text differs from round 1**; the person's label typed outside the constant; the head moved. *Major:* a required-red plant green or a required-green plant red (**the A6 step green under PDown is a Major**); a new row not red-first or able to pass vacuously; axe serious/critical; a second change inside one of the 5 files; a census short; **a regression of any round-1 row**. *Minor:* a false or void message sentence; a pin gap. *Note:* Delete 403 `uat.action-off` on UAT; the reused on-screen sentence; SQL Server NOT TESTED (a CONDITION, not a grade); Azurite-only skips; the non-ASCII in generated `openapi.merged.json`; `FB-...1206` fixture ids; NO PR, CodeQL NOT RUN; unsigned. **GO** = steps 0-6 measured with controls, nothing above Note; **GO WITH FINDINGS** = Minor/Note only; **NO GO (FINAL, round 2 of 2)** on any Blocker or Major.
**First line of STATUS:** `GATE VERDICT B1227: branch b1206/hpsmpoc-feedback-review-held <GO|GO WITH FINDINGS|NO GO> @ f0000f5 on main <sha7> (round 2 of 2 on class held review page and erase, NO GO 1 of 2 before; NO PR, hosted CI, CodeQL NOT RUN - merged tree <id7> = head tree y|n - hygiene tokens new-not-removed <n main..head; n af6fd4c..head>, spec in shard y|n - lead <sha7 equal y|n> one constant y|n - A6 step <red under PDown y|n; green at head y|n> - strings <n of n> - outside paths <n of 5> - authz <n of n> - dispatcher <held sent n> - erase <n of n> - UAT delete <403 y|n; Note> - contract <drift n; copies equal y|n> - migrations <SQLite up/down; SQL Server NOT TESTED> - tests <api; unit; e2e; axe> - plants <red n of n; survivors> - landing files y|residue.md + card-input.txt)`. Body in step order; findings `B1227-n` (severity, `path:line`, instrument, fix-shape); closure table B1221-1, -2, -4 each CLOSED / NOT CLOSED with the numbers; NOT TESTED (SQL Server first); **UNMEASURED last**. **Last line, exactly one of** `VERDICT: B1227 branch b1206/hpsmpoc-feedback-review-held @ f0000f5 <GO|GO WITH FINDINGS|NO GO> (round 2 of 2 on class held review page and erase) on main <sha7>` **or** `STOPPED: NEEDS TUESDAY <one question>`. No line starts `VERDICT:`, `STOPPED:` or `READY` until meant. Heartbeat every 30 s into `.tools/b1227/logs/heartbeat.txt` (3 frozen = stuck). RESUME at 80 percent of context as round 1.
